---
title: "G.A.N.E — Incident Report State Machine"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> pending: User submits report

    pending --> confirmed: N≥3 confirmations<br/>within 500m radius
    pending --> expired: TTL exceeded (30 min)<br/>No confirmations
    pending --> rejected: Admin/AI rejects<br/>Spam or invalid

    confirmed --> active: Auto-promote<br/>Notify affected users
    confirmed --> rejected: Admin review<br/>False positive

    active --> resolving: First "clear" report<br/>or auto-decay timer
    active --> escalated: Severity upgrade<br/>Emergency detected

    escalated --> active: De-escalation<br/>Severity downgrade
    escalated --> resolving: Resolution started

    resolving --> resolved: M≥2 "clear" confirmations<br/>or admin resolution
    resolving --> active: Re-confirmation<br/>Still ongoing

    resolved --> archived: Archive timer (24h)<br/>Move to cold storage
    resolved --> active: Re-reported<br/>Same location

    rejected --> [*]: Permanently removed
    expired --> [*]: Cleaned up
    archived --> [*]: Retention policy<br/>Auto-purge (90 days)

    note right of pending
        Entry: Validate location, type, description
        Guard: Rate limit per user (20/day)
        Action: Geo-cluster with nearby reports
    end note

    note right of confirmed
        Entry: Merge cluster, assign severity
        Guard: Plausibility check
        Action: Create evidence chain entry
    end note

    note right of active
        Entry: Notify users on affected routes
        Action: Update traffic pipeline
        Action: Trigger reroute suggestions
    end note

    note right of escalated
        Entry: Notify emergency services
        Action: Increase notification radius
        Action: Alert fleet operators
    end note
